{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20252",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 5.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Hi there, the the chair's free, sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.66,
      "end_seconds": 10.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Good morning, you know, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.82,
      "end_seconds": 15.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Okay, how are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.32,
      "end_seconds": 25.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "mainly pain in my heel there's a couple of other things, but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.42,
      "end_seconds": 32.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.95,
      "end_seconds": 46.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.7,
      "text": "It's, It's worse with first steps in the morning and standing long. About a six out of ten. It happens once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.04,
      "end_seconds": 50.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.19,
      "end_seconds": 81.83,
      "duration_seconds": 30.64,
      "text": "Yeah, when it starts I tend to get pain after sitting for a while as well. As for pain after sitting for a while, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. With pain after sitting for a while, severe, really. I'd say every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.15,
      "end_seconds": 89.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever or numbness in the foot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.7,
      "end_seconds": 94.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Um, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.57,
      "end_seconds": 99.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "A few quick ones: back pain or swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.72,
      "end_seconds": 107.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Erm, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.41,
      "end_seconds": 113.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.69,
      "end_seconds": 121.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Let me think, um, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.7,
      "end_seconds": 127.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "so, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.73,
      "end_seconds": 138.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "It's, It's hydrocortisone cream, when needed. I'm on insoles, every day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.24,
      "end_seconds": 142.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.29,
      "end_seconds": 147.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Hmm, my father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.08,
      "end_seconds": 154.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.06,
      "end_seconds": 159.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "yes, milk. I get stomach cramps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.72,
      "end_seconds": 178.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions take your time, there's no rush"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.74,
      "end_seconds": 183.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Eczema, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.66,
      "end_seconds": 190.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Yes, eczema is known to us, good to have that clear. And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.09,
      "end_seconds": 194.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.58,
      "end_seconds": 195.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.52,
      "end_seconds": 201.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.16,
      "end_seconds": 205.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.2,
      "end_seconds": 216.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.02,
      "end_seconds": 220.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.1,
      "end_seconds": 223.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.62,
      "end_seconds": 226.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.88,
      "end_seconds": 231.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.27,
      "end_seconds": 252.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.95,
      "end_seconds": 263.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.62,
      "end_seconds": 280.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 123 over 82, temp 36.6 degrees, heart rate 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.37,
      "end_seconds": 286.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.72,
      "end_seconds": 288.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.64,
      "end_seconds": 310.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "There is a sore spot at the inner front of the heel bone and pulling the toes back makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 319.64,
      "end_seconds": 321.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, um, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.23,
      "end_seconds": 334.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like plantar fasciitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.39,
      "end_seconds": 339.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.62,
      "end_seconds": 352.71,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "It's reasonable to to be concerned, but right now plantar fasciitis is my leading thought, not anything worse. I want a foot X-ray done, that's for heel pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.07,
      "end_seconds": 356.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Ah, is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.33,
      "end_seconds": 376.57,
      "duration_seconds": 18.24,
      "text": "I'm prescribing ibuprofen gel, three times a day, for two weeks. It's for heel pain. Stretch the calf and the sole of the foot before getting out of bed and wear cushioned shoes. I think podiatry should see you too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.3,
      "end_seconds": 380.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Oh, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.39,
      "end_seconds": 386.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "If the the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.66,
      "end_seconds": 389.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.87,
      "end_seconds": 398.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "I'll want another look in six weeks. Okay, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 400.74,
      "end_seconds": 404.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.42,
      "end_seconds": 407.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}